{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423","id":1679071195,"node_id":"I_kwDOD7gq785kFJfb","number":8423,"title":"`Decimal` values in `Series` off by factor of a quadrillion when read out using `to_list()`","user":{"login":"alexander-beedie","id":2613171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTMxNzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2613171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-beedie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-beedie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2058875254,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU4ODc1MjU0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"E99695","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":2355548729,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzU1NTQ4NzI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/labels/python","name":"python","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":"Related to Python Polars"},{"id":2355548896,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzU1NTQ4ODk2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/labels/rust","name":"rust","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Related to Rust Polars"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2023-04-21T20:44:28Z","updated_at":"2023-04-26T09:40:45Z","closed_at":"2023-04-26T09:40:45Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Polars version checks\r\n\r\n- [X] I have checked that this issue has not already been reported.\r\n\r\n- [X] I have confirmed this bug exists on the [latest version](https://crates.io/crates/polars) of Polars.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nDecimal values can be scaled by enormous multipliers when read out using `to_list`.\r\n\r\n### Reproducible example\r\n\r\n**Setup:**\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom decimal import Decimal\r\nimport polars as pl\r\n\r\nwith pl.Config( activate_decimals=True ):\r\n    s = pl.Series(\r\n        name = \"dec\", \r\n        values = [Decimal('-1.3492'),Decimal('0.00058910')], \r\n    )\r\n\r\n# Series: 'dec' [decimal[8]]\r\n# [\r\n#   -1.3492\r\n#   0.0005891\r\n# ]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Succeeds:** _(indexing, list init, pyarrow 'to_list')_\r\n\r\n```python\r\ns[0]\r\n# Decimal('-1.34920000')\r\n\r\nlist(s)\r\n# [Decimal('-1.34920000'), Decimal('0.00058910')]\r\n\r\ns.to_list( use_pyarrow=True )\r\n# [Decimal('-1.34920000'), Decimal('0.00058910')]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Fails:** _(native 'to_list' causes scaling)_\r\n\r\n```python\r\ns.to_list()\r\n# [Decimal('-1.34920000E+16'), Decimal('5.8910E+12')]    << scale-factor (one quadrillion :) applied\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nScaling should not occur in `to_list`.\r\n\r\n### Installed versions\r\n\r\n<details>\r\nReplace this line with a list of feature gates\r\n</details>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ritchie46","id":3023000,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjMwMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3023000?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46","html_url":"https://github.com/ritchie46","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ritchie46/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/8423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}